      "description": "Desktop link treatment; mobile uses the actual application menu.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Primary navigation\"><a class=\"ds-focus\" href=\"#services\">Services</a><a class=\"ds-focus\" href=\"#dossier\">Background</a><a class=\"ds-focus\" href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;font-family:var(--font-geist-sans,Geist),ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-nav a{display:inline-flex;min-height:44px;align-items:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted,#526176);text-decoration:none}.ds-nav a:hover{color:var(--foreground,#09090b)}.ds-focus:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--background,#f8fafc),0 0 0 4px var(--primary,#047857)}"
