      "description": "Selected-state specimen of the three-button audience group; application owns URL/state behavior.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-audience\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Choose what to explore\"><span class=\"ds-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><button class=\"ds-focus\" aria-pressed=\"true\">For clients</button><button class=\"ds-focus\" aria-pressed=\"false\">For hiring teams</button><button class=\"ds-focus\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Everything</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-audience{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);width:450px;max-width:calc(100% - 10px);padding:5px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface-hover,#f1f5f9);font-family:var(--font-geist-sans,Geist),ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-marker{position:absolute;top:5px;bottom:5px;left:5px;width:calc((100% - 10px)/3);background:var(--primary,#047857);border-radius:8px;transition:transform .22s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-audience button{position:relative;z-index:1;min-height:44px;border:0;background:transparent;border-radius:8px;padding:0 8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:var(--font-geist-sans,Geist),ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--muted,#526176);cursor:pointer}.ds-audience button[aria-pressed=true]{color:var(--on-primary,#fff)}.ds-audience button[aria-pressed=false]:hover{color:var(--foreground,#09090b)}.ds-audience:has(:focus-visible) .ds-marker{transition:none}.ds-focus:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--background,#f8fafc),0 0 0 4px var(--primary,#047857)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-marker{transition:none}}"
    }
  ],
